l":"https://9anime.or.at/the-worlds-strongest-witch-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"the-detective-is-already-dead-season-2-unknown-anime","title":"The Detective Is Already Dead Season 2","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/the-detective-is-already-dead-season-2.png","description":"The second season of Tantei wa mou, Shindeiru.","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-detective-is-already-dead-season-2-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"The Detective Is Already Dead Season 2","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-detective-is-already-dead-season-2-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"sasaki-and-peeps-season-2-unknown-anime","title":"Sasaki and Peeps Season 2","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/sasaki-and-peeps-season-2.jpg","description":"The second season of Sasaki to Pii-chan.","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/sasaki-and-peeps-season-2-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"Sasaki and Peeps Season 2","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/sasaki-and-peeps-season-2-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"even-though-i-m-a-super-timid-noble-girl-i-accepted-the-bet-from-my-cunning-fiance-unknown-anime","title":"Even Though I’m a Super Timid Noble Girl, I Accepted the Bet From My Cunning Fiancé","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/themes/9animetv/assets/images/noimg165px.png","description":"I was reborn as a villainous daughter in a reverse harem otome game.\n\nAfter being sick with a high fever at the age of 10, Pia Rockwell suddenly remembered her past life as a university student in Japan. But far from going down the villainess route, all this super timid girl wants is to finally use her knowledge from when she was a grad student studying to get her doctorate in paleontology. Her ultimate goal is to become a commoner, excavate fossils, build a museum and then become a curator.\n\nSo in order to escape the villainess route and avoid being deported by her fiancé during the graduation ball, Pia decides to avoid the upcoming hurt and heartache and asks to break off her engagement to Rufus, the Prime Minister's son.\n\nBut will her cunning fiancé let her go that easily?","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/even-though-im-a-super-timid-noble-girl-i-accepted-the-bet-from-my-cunning-fiance-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"Even Though I’m a Super Timid Noble Girl, I Accepted the Bet From My Cunning Fiancé","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/even-though-im-a-super-timid-noble-girl-i-accepted-the-bet-from-my-cunning-fiance-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"magic-knight-rayearth-2026-anime","title":"Magic Knight Rayearth","year":2026,"kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/magic-knight-rayearth-2026.jpg","description":"Hikaru Shidou, Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji aren't from Cephiro. While on a school field trip to the Tokyo Tower, the three girls' minds are on anything but different worlds filled with magic and wonder. That is, until Princess Emeraude, the Pillar of Cephiro, cries out for the Magic Knights to save her world--and that just happens to be those three!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-episode-1-english-subbed/"},{"source":"gogoanime","url":"https://gogoanime.by/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"Magic Knight Rayearth (2026)","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-episode-1-english-subbed/"},{"source":"gogoanime","url":"https://gogoanime.by/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]},{"id":"s1e2","season":1,"number":2,"title":"Shin Tennis no Ouji-sama: U-17 WORLD CUP Kesshou Member Ketteisen\n                                                    \n                                Episode 2","links":[{"source":"gogoanime","url":"https://gogoanime.by/shin-tennis-no-oujisama-u-17-world-cup-kesshou-member-ketteisen-episode-2-english-subbed/"}]},{"id":"s1e5","season":1,"number":5,"title":"Ghost Meets Gal!\n                                                    \n                                Episode 5","links":[{"source":"gogoanime","url":"https://gogoanime.by/ghost-meets-gal-episode-5-english-subbed/"}]},{"id":"s1e14","season":1,"number":14,"title":"Sora wa Akai Kawa no Hotori\n                                                    \n                                Episode 14","links":[{"source":"gogoanime","url":"https://gogoanime.by/sora-wa-akai-kawa-no-hotori-episode-14-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"the-laid-off-cheat-granting-mage-enjoys-a-second-lease-on-life-unknown-anime","title":"The Laid-Off Cheat-Granting Mage Enjoys a Second Lease on Life","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/the-laid-off-cheat-granting-mage-enjoys-a-second-lease-on-life.png","description":"Rein, an enchanter, is suddenly expelled from his guild one day. But instead of despairing, he declares, “Now I can do anything!” and begins reclaiming the massive number of enhancement points he once poured into his guildmates’ gear, setting off on a brand-new path as an adventurer.\nGathering around him are people carrying wounds that don’t fade easily: a genius adventurer who shut her heart after her party was slaughtered, a warrior who lost her family, and an assassin raised from childhood to kill. Yet Rein never rejects their pasts or their scars—he accepts them all with bright, straightforward warmth.\nThe stage is a unique fantasy world where Uzis, slingshots, and even yakuza exist side by side. But in this world, the more people rely on convenient technology, the more their magic weakens, and adventurers grow fragile.\nIntelligent, vicious monsters roam freely, while in the underworld, outlaws bare their greed and ambition as schemes and betrayals intertwine. In a world where ideals and justice are easily crushed, adventurers fight on with nothing but their magic and their convictions.\nThis is the story of those who have lost their place in the world finding a new way to live. Rein and his companions’ wild, free-spirited second life begins now!\n(Source: The Laid-Off Cheat-Granting Mage Enjoys a Second Lease on Life Site)","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-laid-off-cheat-granting-mage-enjoys-a-second-lease-on-life-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"The Laid-Off Cheat-Granting Mage Enjoys a Second Lease on Life","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-laid-off-cheat-granting-mage-enjoys-a-second-lease-on-life-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"battle-spirits-re-zekkai-no-ku-unknown-anime","title":"Battle Spirits [Re] Zekkai No Ku","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/battle-spirits-re-zekkai-no-ku.png","description":"Keio 3, Hinomoto, Eito. As the Bakumatsu throws Japan into turmoil, young Kuu Bashin dreams of becoming stronger through Standard Battle Spirits. His world changes when he encounters Ajara Zetsu, a wandering samurai and formidable Eternal Battler pursued by anti-shogunate forces. As the worlds of Standard and Eternal Battle collide, Kuu is pulled into Zetsu’s journey—and sets history in motion.\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/battle-spirits-re-zekkai-no-ku-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"Battle Spirits [Re] Zekkai No Ku","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/battle-spirits-re-zekkai-no-ku-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"super-psychic-policeman-chojo-unknown-anime","title":"Super Psychic Policeman Chojo","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/super-psychic-policeman-chojo.jpg","description":"The ultimate police duo is here to keep the peace! Rookie officer Nao just joined the force. She’s got a black belt in judo and earned the nickname “Gorilla” for her insane strength. Then there’s her partner Chojo, who wields every psychic power imaginable. But for a guy who can read minds, he still can’t seem to read the room. Now, these two are taking on crime together in Chinjuku.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/super-psychic-policeman-chojo-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"Super Psychic Policeman Chojo","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/super-psychic-policeman-chojo-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"the-cold-sato-san-is-only-sweet-to-me-unknown-anime","title":"The Cold Sato-san is Only Sweet to Me","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/the-cold-sato-san-is-only-sweet-to-me.jpg","description":"","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-cold-sato-san-is-only-sweet-to-me-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","season":1,"number":1,"title":"The Cold Sato-san is Only Sweet to Me","links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/the-cold-sato-san-is-only-sweet-to-me-episode-1-english-subbed/"}]}]},{"id":"nia-liston-the-merciless-maiden-unknown-anime","title":"Nia Liston: The Merciless Maiden","kind":"anime","poster":"https://9anime.or.at/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/nia-liston-the-merciless-maiden.png","description":"","genres":[],"links":[{"source":"9anime-or","url":"https://9anime.or.at/nia-liston-the-merciless-maiden-episode-1-english-subbed/"}],"episodes":[{"id":"s1e1","